Scoped colorcontrast video filter

The option table (rc, gm, by, rcw, gmw, byw, pl as AV_OPT_TYPE_FLOAT), pixel_fmts,
config_input's step and ff_fill_rgba_map offsets, the lerpf helper, the PROCESS
macro and the eight-bit slice functions colorcontrast_slice8 (gbrp) and
colorcontrast_slice8p (packed RGB(A)) in src/video-ops/colorcontrast.ts follow
libavfilter/vf_colorcontrast.c (colorcontrast_options, pixel_fmts, config_input,
filter_frame, lerpf, PROCESS, colorcontrast_slice8, colorcontrast_slice8p), with
the av_clipf, av_clip_uint8 and FFMAX3/FFMIN3 semantics of libavutil/common.h and
libavutil/macros.h, and the AV_OPT_TYPE_FLOAT parsing of libavutil/opt.c
(set_string_number, write_number).
