This is a scoped TypeScript adaptation, not the complete colorcontrast filter:
only the eight-bit formats with frame storage here (rgb24, bgr24, rgba, bgra,
argb, abgr, gbrp), single-precision arithmetic emulated with Math.fround, no
timeline and no runtime commands.
